      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْزِىٌّ</span></b>  [as pass. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَزَا</span>] was used as an
epithet applied to a man: it is properly with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>
[i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغْزُوٌّ</span>]; but there are many instances of the
